#: contents/ui/config/tabs/ConfigAlertsTab.qml:344
msgid ""
"Alerts provider: <a href='https://alerts.kde.org/'>FOSS Public Alert Server</a"
"><br/><br/>KDE's FOSS Public Alert Server collects official severe-weather war"
"nings in CAP format from agencies worldwide and matches them to your exact loc"
"ation. Alert notifications work the same as with the native provider."
msgstr ""
"警报数据源：<a href='https://alerts.kde.org/'>FOSS Public Alert Server</a><br/><br/>"
"KDE 的 FOSS Public Alert Server 会收集世界各地气象机构以 CAP 格式发布的官方严重天气警告，并将其匹配到你的精确位置。警报通"
"知的工作方式与原生数据源相同。"

#: contents/ui/config/tabs/ConfigAlertsTab.qml:334
msgid ""
"Alerts provider: <a href='https://librewxr.net/'>LibreWXR</a><br/><br/>LibreWX"
"R is a free, open-source weather API that aggregates official CAP alerts world"
"wide (WMO Severe Weather Information Centre, NOAA NWS, and others) and matches"
" them to your exact location. Alert notifications work the same as with the na"
"tive provider."
msgstr ""
"警报数据源：<a href='https://librewxr.net/'>LibreWXR</a><br/><br/>LibreWXR 是一个免费、开源的"
"天气 API，会聚合全球官方 CAP 警报（WMO Severe Weather Information Centre、NOAA NWS 等），并将其匹配到"
"你的精确位置。警报通知的工作方式与原生数据源相同。"

#: contents/ui/config/tabs/ConfigAlertsTab.qml:324
msgid ""
"Alerts provider: <a href='https://www.meteoalarm.org/'>EUMETNET MeteoAlarm</a>"
" + <a href='https://www.weather.gov/'>NOAA NWS</a><br/><br/>European locations"
" use the official MeteoAlarm feeds (38 countries), US locations use the NOAA N"
"ational Weather Service alerts API, with met.no MetAlerts as a fallback. If yo"
"ur weather provider delivers its own alerts (e.g. WeatherAPI.com, Pirate Weath"
"er), those are used directly."
msgstr ""
"警报数据源：<a href='https://www.meteoalarm.org/'>EUMETNET MeteoAlarm</a> + <a href="
"'https://www.weather.gov/'>NOAA NWS</a><br/><br/>欧洲地区使用官方 MeteoAlarm 源（38 个国家）"
"，美国地区使用 NOAA National Weather Service 警报 API，并以 met.no MetAlerts 作为回退。如果你的天气数据"
"源提供自己的警报（例如 WeatherAPI.com、Pirate Weather），则会直接使用这些警报。"

