"Open-Meteo is always tried first - it is free and requires no API key. AEMET i"
"s intentionally not part of this list, as it only covers Spain and is not suit"
"able for global use."
msgstr ""
"按以下顺序尝试数据源，直到成功获取数据：\n"
"Open-Meteo  →  BBC Weather  →  met.no  →  Pirate Weather  →  Visual Crossing  "
"→  Tomorrow.io  →  StormGlass  →  Weatherbit  →  QWeather  →  OpenWeatherMap  "
"→  WeatherAPI.com\n"
" 如需选择特定数据源，请关闭自适应模式。\n"
"始终优先尝试 Open-Meteo，因为它免费且无需 API 密钥。AEMET 被有意排除在此列表之外，因为它仅覆盖西班牙，不适合在全球范围使用。"

