#: contents/ui/components/weathermap/HelpPanel.qml:119
msgid ""
"The CAMS forecast. The colors follow the European Air Quality Index: cyan good"
", green fair, yellow moderate, red poor, dark red very poor, purple extremely "
"poor. The scale is logarithmic: each band covers a wider range than the one be"
"fore."
msgstr ""
"CAMS 预报按欧洲空气质量指数配色。青色表示良好，绿色表示尚可，黄色表示中等，红色表示较差，深红色表示很差，紫色表示极差。色标采用对数刻度，后一个色带覆盖"
"的数值范围比前一个更宽。"

#: contents/ui/config/tabs/ConfigWidgetTab.qml:1012
msgid ""
"The Details, Forecast and History tabs are built in the background after start"
"up and stay built when the widget is closed, so it opens at once. This uses mo"
"re memory for the whole session, and the History tab loads its data at startup"
"."
msgstr ""
"启动后在后台预先加载详情、预报和历史标签页。收起小组件后仍保留这些页面，以便下次立即打开。该功能会在整个会话中占用更多内存，历史标签页也会在启动时加载数据。"

#: contents/ui/config/tabs/ConfigRadarTab.qml:500
msgid ""
"The Radar tab can animate the wind as moving particles (switch it on there). T"
"he wind data comes from <a href='https://open-meteo.com/'>Open-Meteo</a>, inde"
"pendently of the LibreWXR server. This sets the frame rate: lower it on a slow"
" computer, raise it if strong winds look jerky."
msgstr ""
"雷达标签页可使用移动粒子展示风场动画（在该标签页中开启）。风场数据来自 <a href='https://open-meteo.com/'>Open-Met"
"eo</a>，独立于 LibreWXR 服务器。此处用于设置动画帧率：电脑性能较低时可降低帧率；如果强风动画不连贯，可提高帧率。"

#: contents/ui/config/tabs/ConfigRadarTab.qml:168
msgid ""
"The Radar tab opens at once on the most recent radar image, and the animation "
"plays at once. It uses about 200 MB more memory: leave it off on a computer wi"
"th little memory."
msgstr "打开雷达标签页时会立即显示最新雷达画面并播放动画。这会多占用约 200 MB 内存，内存较少时请关闭。"

#: contents/ui/RadarView.qml:345
msgid ""
"The Radar tab requires the QtWebEngine package, which is not installed on this"
" system."
msgstr "雷达标签页需要 QtWebEngine 软件包，但当前系统尚未安装。"

#: contents/ui/config/configLocation.qml:379
msgid "The auto-detected location is already in your saved list."
msgstr "自动检测到的位置已在你的已保存列表中。"

#: contents/ui/config/tabs/ConfigRadarTab.qml:842
msgid ""
"The cache is full: the oldest images make room for the new ones. If the map do"
"wnloads areas it has already shown again, choose a larger size."
msgstr "缓存已满，最早的图像会被移除，为新图像腾出空间。若地图反复下载已浏览过的区域，可增大缓存上限。"

#: contents/ui/config/tabs/ConfigRadarTab.qml:833
msgid "The cache will be cleared the next time the map opens."
msgstr "下次打开地图时将清除缓存。"

#: contents/ui/ForecastView.qml:1128 contents/ui/ForecastView.qml:1916
#: contents/ui/HistoryView.qml:1026
msgid "The chart needs the Qt Graphs or the KDE Quick Charts QML module."
msgstr "图表需要 Qt Graphs 或 KDE Quick Charts QML 模块。"

#: contents/ui/components/weathermap/HelpPanel.qml:145
msgid ""
"The colored layers share the map, one at a time: temperature, pressure, humidi"
"ty, dew point, air quality. The column lists the layers as they are stacked on"
" the map, the top one first; the order is set with the button left of the sett"
"ings. The wind always goes over the others."
msgstr ""
"气温、气压、湿度、露点和空气质量这些着色图层每次只能显示一个。图层栏按叠放顺序排列，列表第一项显示在最上层。用设置左侧的排序按钮可调整顺序。风场始终显示在其"
"他图层上方。"

#: contents/ui/config/configAppearance.qml:929
msgid ""
"The condition icon will automatically reflect the current weather using your K"
"DE system icon theme. No customisation is needed."
msgstr "天气状况图标会根据当前天气自动使用您的 KDE 系统图标主题。无需自定义。"

#: contents/ui/config/tabs/ConfigWidgetTab.qml:238
msgid "The geomagnetic (Kp/G) forecast is only available up to 3 days ahead"
msgstr "地磁（Kp/G）预报最多只提供未来 3 天"

#: contents/ui/components/WeatherMapView.qml:1881
msgid ""
"The global model, then the finer regional<br>ones drawn over it in this view"
msgstr "先显示全球模式<br>再叠加当前视图中的高分辨率区域模式"

#: contents/ui/components/weathermap/HelpPanel.qml:80
msgid ""
"The infrared picture of the clouds, from LibreWXR: the colder the top, the hig"
"her and whiter the cloud."
msgstr "LibreWXR 提供的红外云图。云顶越冷，云层越高，在图上也越白。"

#: contents/ui/components/weathermap/HelpPanel.qml:108
msgid ""
"The isobars join the points of equal pressure. The wind blows almost along the"
"m, counterclockwise around a low in the northern hemisphere. The closer they a"
"re, the stronger the wind."
msgstr "等压线连接气压相同的点。风大致沿等压线吹，在北半球绕低压中心逆时针流动。等压线越密，风越强。"

#: contents/ui/components/weathermap/HelpPanel.qml:132
msgid "The layer column"
msgstr "图层栏"

#: contents/ui/components/weathermap/HelpPanel.qml:161
msgid "The line"
msgstr "时间线"

#: contents/ui/components/weathermap/HelpPanel.qml:86
msgid ""
"The lines flow with the wind, their color is the speed (the wind palette of th"
"e settings). By default: white when calm, green and blue for a breeze, yellow "
"and orange for a strong wind, red and violet for a storm. Where the lines bunc"
"h up and turn, the weather changes."
msgstr ""
"线条沿风向流动，颜色按设置中的风速配色方案表示风速。默认用白色表示无风，绿色和蓝色表示微风，黄色和橙色表示强风，红色和紫色表示风暴。线条密集且转向的地方往往"
"伴随天气变化。"

#: contents/ui/config/subpages/ConfigMapSubPage.qml:461
msgid "The map could not be loaded. Check your internet connection."
msgstr "无法加载地图。请检查你的网络连接。"

#: contents/ui/config/subpages/ConfigMapSubPage.qml:471
msgid ""
"The map needs QtWebEngine, which is not installed. You can still search for a "
"location above."
msgstr "地图功能需要 QtWebEngine，但当前尚未安装。你仍然可以在上方搜索位置。"

#: contents/ui/components/WeatherMapView.qml:1822
msgid "The map page needs WebGL, which this graphics setup does not offer."
msgstr "天气地图需要 WebGL，当前图形环境不支持此功能。"

#: contents/ui/config/configLocation.qml:1186
msgid ""
"The map picker requires the QtLocation and QtPositioning packages, which are n"
"ot installed on this system."
msgstr "地图选点功能需要 QtLocation 和 QtPositioning 软件包，但当前系统尚未安装。"

#: contents/ui/components/weathermap/HelpPanel.qml:186
msgid ""
"The same keys in every language. They work while the Weather Map tab is shown."
msgstr "切换语言不会改变快捷键。显示天气地图标签页时，这些快捷键才生效。"

#: contents/ui/components/weathermap/HelpPanel.qml:112
msgid ""
"The temperature at which dew forms. It tells how much water the air really hol"
"ds. Under 10 °C the air feels dry, at 13 to 16 °C you notice it, from 18 °C it"
" is muggy, from 21 °C oppressive, from 24 °C tropical. When the night cools do"
"wn to the dew point, dew or fog forms."
msgstr ""
"露点是水汽开始凝结时的温度，能反映空气中实际含有多少水汽。露点低于 10 °C 时感觉干燥，13 至 16 °C 时能感觉到湿气，18 °C 起感觉闷热，2"
"1 °C 起闷热难耐，24 °C 起就像身处热带。夜间气温降到露点时，会形成露或雾。"

#: contents/ui/components/weathermap/HelpPanel.qml:133
msgid ""
"The thin button on its left edge opens or folds it. The map stays where it is "
"when the column opens over it."
msgstr "用图层栏左缘的细长按钮展开或收起图层栏。展开时，图层栏覆盖在地图上，地图位置保持不变。"

#: contents/ui/components/weathermap/HelpPanel.qml:147
msgid "The two clocks: how far back and how far ahead"
msgstr "两个时钟按钮分别设置回看和预报范围"

#: contents/ui/components/WeatherMapView.qml:1821
msgid "The weather maps cannot play here"
msgstr "当前环境无法运行天气地图"

#: contents/ui/components/weathermap/HelpPanel.qml:99
msgid ""
"The whiter, the more of the sky is covered. With the three levels ticked you s"
"ee the model's total cover, without counting twice the clouds over each other."
msgstr "颜色越白，云量越大。选中三个高度的云层后，会显示模式给出的总云量，重叠的云层不会重复计算。"

#: contents/ui/DetailsView.qml:1456
msgid ""
"The widget collects pressure readings as it updates; about an hour of readings"
" is needed to work out the trend."
msgstr "小组件在更新时收集气压读数，需要约 1 小时的数据才能算出趋势。"

#: contents/ui/components/weathermap/LayerPanel.qml:529
msgid ""
"The wind is drawn over the map, so over every layer wherever it is in this lis"
"t: its place here orders the column of the tab only."
msgstr "无论风场在列表中的位置如何，它始终绘制在所有图层上方。这里的位置只影响标签页中图层栏的顺序。"

#: contents/ui/config/configGeneral.qml:227
